# Changelog

All notable changes to the XoL documentation will be documented in this file.

## [2026-06-30]

### Added
- [WorldMap of Scenery](docs/de/Maps.md) gained a "Scenery since" year filter — a slider that shows only sceneries updated since a selected year

### Changed
- [ATC Flight Planner](https://atc.emvisio.de) (linked from [Maps](docs/de/Maps.md) and [VATSIM](docs/de/flight_operations/vatsim/vatsim.md)) now shows the scenery's last update date
  - New "Scenery Date" tile in the airport scenery panel, with all archive dates in the tooltip

## [2026-02-09]

### Added
- New [XEarthLayer](docs/de/addon/xearthlayer.md) documentation page (DE+EN)
  - Rust-based streaming alternative with adaptive prefetch
  - Binary packages, installation, usage, regional packages, comparison with AutoOrtho
- [X-Plane Map Enhancement](https://github.com/derekhe/xplane-map-enhancement-release) (XPME) added as streaming solution

### Changed
- [Orthophotography Introduction](docs/de/addon/orthophotography_intro.md) restructured
  - New categories: Static Generation vs Ortho Streaming
  - Player profile recommendations with generic terms instead of product names
- [AutoOrtho](docs/de/addon/autoortho.md) documentation updated
  - ProgrammingDinosaur Fork 2.0: C-Pipeline, .aob2 bundle format, extended map providers
  - Comparison with Ortho4XP promoted to H2 with player profile recommendations
  - Cache eviction behavior clarified
- [Static + Streaming](docs/de/addon/static_plus_streaming.md) renamed and rewritten
  - Renamed from `autoortho_plus_zortho.md` to `static_plus_streaming.md`
  - WIP banner removed, content fully revised
  - AutoOrtho-specific examples marked as such

## [2025-06-05]

### Added
- Additional information about aliasing and graphics settings
  - Detailed explanation of anti-aliasing techniques in X-Plane
  - Comprehensive guide on graphics settings optimization
  - Technical details about the Nyquist-Shannon Theorem and its application

## [2025-05-08]

### Added
- [Statisch + Streaming Guide](docs/de/addon/static_plus_streaming.md) significantly expanded
  - Added comprehensive guide on combining Ortho4XP and AutoOrtho
  - Added practical examples and best practices
  - Improved structure and removed redundancies

## [2025-05-05]

### Added
- Neue [Dateisystem-Dokumentation](docs/de/filesystem.md) / New [filesystem documentation](docs/en/filesystem.md)
- Discord community channel added
  - Link available in the footer of both German and English versions
  - Join our community for discussions and support

## [2025-05-04]

### Changed
- [Scenery Documentation](docs/de/scenery.md) revised
  - List formatting corrected (indentation, spaces)
  - English version aligned with German version
  - [Resources/Maps section](docs/de/scenery.md#ressourcen) updated
    - Self-created WorldMaps and their purpose highlighted
    - Limitations of ICAO code search for X-Plane 12 scenery documented
- [Ortho4XP Guide](docs/de/ortho4xp.md) extended
  - New chapter [File Size Optimization](docs/de/ortho4xp.md#optimierung-der-dateigröße) added

## [2025-05-03]

### Added
- New chapter [Scenery Tips](docs/de/blog/kcle-cleveland.html) added to Scenery Documentation
  - Collection of useful tips and tricks for scenery management
  - Best practices for scenery organization and optimization

## Format

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

### Types of changes

- `Added` for new features
- `Changed` for changes in existing functionality
- `Deprecated` for soon-to-be removed features
- `Removed` for now removed features
- `Fixed` for any bug fixes
- `Security` in case of vulnerabilities 